  "body": "## Problem\n\nThe v0.26.0 cut gate prints this warning:\n\n```\nwarning: unused workspace dependency `truck-polymesh`\n   --> Cargo.toml:124:1\n    |\n124 | truck-polymesh = \"=0.6.0\"\n    | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n    |\n    = note: `cargo::unused_workspace_dependencies` is set to `warn` by default\n```\n\nNo crate uses `truck-polymesh` now. Solidcore replaced truck for STEP meshing (#916, #917).\n\n## Fix\n\n- Remove the `truck-polymesh` line from `[workspace.dependencies]` in the root `Cargo.toml`.\n- Check that no other `truck-*` workspace entry is unused.\n- Update `Cargo.lock`. Make sure that the build does not print the warning.\n\n## Notes\n\n- Do not change the `release/v0.26.0` branch. The fix goes to `main` after the tag.\n- Also check `assets/ui/LICENSES.md` for a truck notice that is no longer necessary.\n",
